# Azahar a/b testing

Full workflow for agents: **`ab_test/README.md`**.

## Hard prefs

- **Never** tell the user to “fully quit Azahar” between tests — they already do.
- Do not put quit/restart Azahar in checklists unless diagnosing a proven LayeredFS reload failure.

## Quick commands

```powershell
.\make.ps1 instances
.\make.ps1 deploy-a    # current default stack → instance A
.\make.ps1 launch-a
.\make.ps1 restore-a
```

Instance roots: `out/azahar_instances/{a,b}/user` (`NLPP_AZAHAR_USER_DIR`).
Scripts: `ab_test/`. Feature details: `technical.md`.
